    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d19-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d19-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Library of Congress, Manuscript Division, Kissinger Papers, CL 312,
                    Meetings, National Security Council, February–March, 1969. Confidential. Similar
                    talking points were also prepared for Kissinger. (Ibid.) Time did not permit
                    discussion of East-West relations at the NSC meeting on February 19.</p>
            </note>
